    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and figure out this strange little command line game. Use all the items in your inventory and outventory to solve each level. Take each mechanic a bit past its conclusion and learn a little bit more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With zero secrets you can take your time and solve all 50+ mostly short levels in this completely linear game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made entirely from scratch, so you can get to experience all the quirks and consequences that come along with that, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >strange controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weird music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unfamiliar game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ascii art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a general sense of apathy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a full user manual</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a full copy of the game code for you to look at</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes several vaguely unique items. Here are all of them: <div class=\"bb_code\">AX#oOyYp-C=Rr^~M&gt;&lt;lLbTH,Wj_</div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and figure out this strange little command line game. Use all the items in your inventory and outventory to solve each level. Take each mechanic a bit past its conclusion and learn a little bit more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With zero secrets you can take your time and solve all 50+ mostly short levels in this completely linear game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made entirely from scratch, so you can get to experience all the quirks and consequences that come along with that, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >strange controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weird music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unfamiliar game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ascii art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a general sense of apathy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a full user manual</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a full copy of the game code for you to look at</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes several vaguely unique items. Here are all of them: <div class=\"bb_code\">AX#oOyYp-C=Rr^~M&gt;&lt;lLbTH,Wj_</div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
